cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TRIARCHY, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "TRIARCHY: control-aware integration of WMS, 16S, and ITS microbiome assays"
abstract: >-
  TRIARCHY is a production Nextflow workflow for control-aware integration of
  matched whole-genome shotgun metagenomics, 16S rRNA gene sequencing, and
  fungal ITS sequencing in environmental microbiome studies.
authors:
  - family-names: Lucaci
    given-names: Alexander
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aglucaci/TRIARCHY"
url: "https://github.com/aglucaci/TRIARCHY"
license: GPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - microbiome
  - metagenomics
  - 16S rRNA
  - ITS
  - Nextflow
  - bioinformatics
